---
sequenceDiagram
  actor Browser
  box OCC controller
    participant Auth as Auth / Better Auth
    participant State as State / PostgreSQL
    participant IAM as Native IAM
  end
  participant GitHub
  Note over Browser,GitHub: Prerequisite: administrator enrolled this GitHub identity
  Browser->>Auth: Start GitHub login
  Auth->>State: Save browser-bound attempt (5 minutes)
  State-->>Auth: Commit confirmed
  Auth-->>Browser: GitHub URL + attempt cookie
  Browser->>GitHub: Sign in and authorize
  GitHub-->>Browser: Redirect with code and state
  Browser->>Auth: Callback + attempt cookie
  Auth->>State: Validate and consume attempt once
  State-->>Auth: Commit confirmed
  Note over Auth,State: Invalid or uncertain consumption stops here
  Auth->>GitHub: Exchange code, then read /user
  GitHub-->>Auth: Token and numeric user ID
  Auth->>Auth: Discard provider token
  Auth->>State: Resolve enrollment, check account, save session + audit
  alt Session committed
    State-->>Auth: Session + expiry
    Auth-->>Browser: Session cookie, return to Console
  else Login refused or commit uncertain
    Auth-->>Browser: Generic failure, no session cookie
  end
  Browser->>Auth: Read an existing Agent
  Auth->>State: Check stored session and account
  State-->>Auth: Current local Principal, or deny
  Auth->>IAM: Authorize exact Agent read if session valid
  IAM-->>Auth: Allow or deny
  Auth-->>Browser: Agent data or access denied
